('127.166.d.1.B',4,'A crew member who keeps equipment organized and admits mistakes quickly is showing:','["Impatience", "Secrecy", "Laziness", "Dependability and honesty"]'::jsonb,3,'Personal qualities.','original'),
('127.166.d.1.C',3,'The best way to find openings for production assistants is to:','["Search job boards and contact local studios", "Wait at home", "Avoid networking", "Ignore postings"]'::jsonb,0,'Seeking employment.','original'),
('127.166.d.1.C',4,'An applicant tailors a cover letter to a TV station by mentioning:','["Complaints about past jobs", "Skills that match the posted job", "Salary demands only", "Unrelated hobbies"]'::jsonb,1,'Applying for employment.','original'),
('127.166.d.1.D',3,'A resume for a video job should highlight:','["Home address history", "Every school lunch", "Relevant skills, equipment experience, and projects", "Childhood photos"]'::jsonb,2,'Resume.','original'),
('127.166.d.1.D',4,'A letter of interest is sent to a company that:','["Requires no resume", "Has no staff", "Is closed", "May not have posted an opening yet"]'::jsonb,3,'Letter of interest.','original'),
