('127.166.d.3.A',3,'A producer pitches a documentary to a school board with formal language and to friends casually. This adapts language to:','["The audience and situation", "The tripod", "The camera", "The cable"]'::jsonb,0,'Adapt language.','original'),
('127.166.d.3.A',4,'Changing the wording of a news script for a younger audience is adjusting for:','["Weather", "Purpose and audience", "Battery level", "Lens type"]'::jsonb,1,'Adapt language for purpose.','original'),
('127.166.d.3.B',3,'Sorting interview notes by topic before writing a script is:','["Guessing", "Erasing notes", "Organizing information", "Losing notes"]'::jsonb,2,'Organize information.','original'),
