('127.166.d.3.C',4,'The audio engineer says, "Levels are peaking in the red." This communicates:','["A joke", "Technical data the team can act on", "A rumor", "An unrelated opinion"]'::jsonb,1,'Communicate data.','original'),
('127.166.d.3.D',3,'A student pitch to a panel of judges with a prepared slide deck is a:','["Rehearsal only", "Private note", "Formal presentation", "Casual hallway chat"]'::jsonb,2,'Formal presentation.','original'),
