('127.166.d.3.E',4,'Eye contact and nodding while a director gives notes show:','["Boredom", "Attention and respect", "Rudeness", "Anger"]'::jsonb,1,'Active listening.','original'),
('127.166.d.3.F',3,'On a mixed crew with different backgrounds, a respectful practice is to:','["Ignore language differences", "Dismiss newcomers", "Listen to every member''s ideas", "Interrupt often"]'::jsonb,2,'Diverse individuals.','original'),
('127.166.d.3.F',4,'Interviewing a guest who speaks softly or with an accent calls for:','["Cutting them off", "Speaking over them", "Impatience", "Patience and clear questions"]'::jsonb,3,'Speak with diverse individuals.','original'),
('127.166.d.3.G',3,'Public relations skills for a video producer include:','["Treating clients and viewers professionally", "Ignoring emails", "Hiding credit", "Arguing online"]'::jsonb,0,'PR skills.','original'),
('127.166.d.3.G',4,'A producer answers a negative review by:','["Ignoring all feedback", "Responding politely and offering to help", "Insulting the reviewer", "Deleting every post"]'::jsonb,1,'PR response.','original'),
('127.166.d.4.A',3,'A group deciding between two story angles uses critical thinking by:','["Choosing at random", "Avoiding choice", "Comparing the strengths of each angle", "Following the loudest"]'::jsonb,2,'Critical thinking.','original'),
('127.166.d.4.A',4,'A team tests two shot setups and picks the one that tells the story best. This relies on:','["Luck", "Volume", "Rank", "Evidence and reasoning"]'::jsonb,3,'Group critical thinking.','original'),
('127.166.d.4.B',3,'Two crew members argue about a lighting choice. A helpful interpersonal skill is:','["Listening and finding common ground", "Name calling", "Taking sides", "Walking out"]'::jsonb,0,'Interpersonal skills.','original'),
('127.166.d.4.B',4,'A group solves a scheduling problem best when members:','["Blame others", "Share ideas and agree on a plan", "Work in secret", "Refuse to compromise"]'::jsonb,1,'Group problem solving.','original'),
