('127.166.d.6.A',4,'A grip should lock stand wheels and use sandbags because a light stand can:','["Run out of power", "Make shadows", "Change color", "Tip over and injure someone"]'::jsonb,3,'Equipment safety.','original'),
('127.166.d.6.B',3,'During a power failure in the studio, the crew should:','["Follow the emergency plan and evacuate if told", "Keep working", "Climb the grid", "Plug in more lights"]'::jsonb,0,'Emergency procedures.','original'),
('127.166.d.6.B',4,'Knowing where the fire extinguisher and first aid kit are before a shoot helps with:','["Smoother edits", "A faster emergency response", "Cleaner audio", "Better lighting"]'::jsonb,1,'Emergency procedures.','original'),
('127.166.d.6.C',3,'If a frayed power cord is found on set, the right action is to:','["Ignore it", "Tape it and keep using it", "Report it and stop using it", "Hide it"]'::jsonb,2,'Report safety problems.','original'),
('127.166.d.6.C',4,'A hot lighting instrument left near a curtain should be:','["Covered with cloth", "Left alone", "Turned higher", "Moved and reported as a fire hazard"]'::jsonb,3,'Identify and report hazards.','original'),
('127.166.d.7.A',3,'A student who organizes tasks, sets a clear goal, and encourages the crew shows:','["Leadership", "Confusion", "Delay", "Distraction"]'::jsonb,0,'Leadership.','original'),
('127.166.d.7.A',4,'Delegating tasks to match each member''s strengths is part of:','["Poor planning", "Effective leadership", "Avoiding teamwork", "Micromanaging only"]'::jsonb,1,'Leadership.','original'),
('127.166.d.7.B',3,'Crew members who help each other finish a late shot are showing:','["Competition", "Delay", "Teamwork", "Isolation"]'::jsonb,2,'Teamwork.','original'),
