('127.166.d.7.D',4,'Participating in mentoring benefits the mentee by:','["Giving less experience", "Limiting growth", "Lowering confidence", "Providing guidance and feedback"]'::jsonb,3,'Mentoring.','original'),
('127.166.d.8.A',3,'Interviewing a person and using their words accurately shows:','["Ethical conduct", "Careless editing", "Deception", "Cheating"]'::jsonb,0,'Ethical conduct.','original'),
