('127.167.d.12.B',3,'A production timeline lists:','["Tasks with start and finish dates", "Only props", "Only actors", "Only costs"]'::jsonb,0,'Timelines.','original'),
('127.167.d.12.B',4,'To set a timeline, a producer often starts from the:','["Lunch time", "Delivery deadline and works backward", "Crew shirts", "Weather"]'::jsonb,1,'Establish timelines.','original'),
('127.167.d.12.C',3,'A production budget includes costs for cast, crew, equipment, and:','["Sports", "Holidays", "Locations", "Birthdays"]'::jsonb,2,'Budget.','original'),
